10	 * request with no postcode passes through unchanged (the create/update contract stays
11	 * backward-compatible). Its 4-digit shape is already enforced by the {@code OwnerFields}
12	 * schema pattern; this step applies the region-specific range rule. For a city with a known
13	 * region (Sydney=NSW 2000-2099, Melbourne=VIC 3000-3099, Brisbane=QLD 4000-4099) the postcode
14	 * must fall within that region's inclusive range; a city with no known region accepts any
15	 * 4-digit postcode. An out-of-range postcode is rejected 400 via {@link InvalidPostcodeException}.
16	 */
17	public class EnsurePostcodeValidForCity {
